%% Request Flow: Standard Inference
%% Shows the complete path from client to response

sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant H as Handler
    participant R as Router
    participant P as Provider
    participant E as External LLM
    participant M as Metrics

    C->>G: POST /v1/infer<br/>{model, messages}

    activate G
    G->>G: CORS, Recovery, TraceID
    G->>H: Route to InferHandler
    activate H

    H->>H: Parse & Validate Request
    H->>H: Check Optimizer Mode

    alt Mode: go
        H->>R: Use Go Router
        activate R
        R->>R: Select Provider<br/>(policy/model/optimization)
        R->>P: Route to Provider
    else Mode: rust (sampled)
        H->>R: Try Rust Optimizer
        R-->>H: Rust Error
        H->>R: Automatic Fallback to Go
        R->>P: Route to Provider
    end

    activate P
    P->>E: HTTP Request to LLM
    E-->>P: LLM Response
    deactivate P

    P-->>R: InferResponse
    deactivate R

    R-->>H: Response + Metadata

    H->>M: Record Metrics<br/>(latency, tokens, cost)

    H->>H: Calculate Cost<br/>Add Trace ID
    H-->>G: JSON Response
    deactivate H

    G-->>C: 200 OK<br/>X-Trace-ID: xxx
    deactivate G

    Note over M: Prometheus: infer_requests_total++<br/>latency, cost, tokens recorded
